	(text "Twelve concrete boards, one 2x20P backplane connector group per board. Every inter-board net is a global label; the passive backplane only wires slot pins together.\nIMAGE -> CONV1 -> POOL1 -> CONV2 -> POOL2 -> FC1 -> FC2 -> ARGMAX -> RESULT\nBoard path: B12 -> B04 -> B05 -> B06 -> B07 -> B08 -> B09 -> B10 -> B12"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25 24 0)
		(effects
